sequenceDiagram
    actor SuperAdmin
    participant Browser
    participant MVC as HomeController
    participant Analytics as AnalyticsService
    participant UoW as UnitOfWork
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant UserMgr as UserManager

    SuperAdmin->>Browser: Navigate to Home/Index after login
    Browser->>MVC: GET Index
    MVC->>MVC: Check role not Doctor-only or Staff-only

    MVC->>Analytics: GetOrthoDashboard()
    Analytics->>UoW: GetRepository Appointment
    Analytics->>UoW: GetRepository Patient
    Analytics->>UoW: GetRepository Doctor
    Analytics->>UoW: GetRepository Payment

    UoW->>DB: COUNT appointments by status
    UoW->>DB: COUNT total patients
    UoW->>DB: COUNT active doctors
    UoW->>DB: SUM recent payments
    DB-->>Analytics: aggregated metrics

    Analytics-->>MVC: OrthoDashboardViewModel

    MVC->>UserMgr: GetUserAsync(current user)
    UserMgr->>DB: SELECT AspNetUsers
    UserMgr-->>MVC: ApplicationUser
    MVC->>MVC: Set WelcomeName on dashboard model

    MVC-->>Browser: Home/Index view with metric cards
    Browser-->>SuperAdmin: Dashboard with welcome message and analytics

    Note over SuperAdmin,DB: Doctor and Staff-only users are redirected to Patient/Index instead
